      "title": "多位訪員關懷社區老人之路徑規劃",
      "title_en": "Path-Finding Algorithm for two Home Visitor to all Community Elders",
      "abstract": "因為我們社會的社區老人越來越多，需要福利單位有配置家訪員拜訪和了解老人的情況。傳統方法是一位家訪員拜訪全部社區的老人，但這樣往往有很多時間的消耗和老人剛好外出無法拜訪的缺點。傳統的路徑規劃大多針對一位旅行者進行拜訪全部節點，最小化總長度的研究[1]。\n\n本論文研究如何有效率地拜訪社區老人，每位家訪員到社區老師每一戶拜訪時間假設是固定，論文也假設所有社區老人都在家中等待拜訪；且研究有多位家訪員如何配置可以最有效率縮短家訪時間。針對一個路徑規劃題目: 有多位家訪員、需要關懷的社區老人所在的受訪家庭，探討拜訪每個社區老人在兩位訪員人力分配之合適規劃。本計畫特點：第一個規劃單個拜訪員的拜訪全部待訪員之路徑規劃、第二個探討規劃多個拜訪員的拜訪全部社區老人之路徑規劃。最佳化目標是最小化拜訪全部受訪家庭總時間，包含路徑長度時間和每個社區老人家訪的時間，透過不同權重比例，發現我們多位訪員，可以減少拜訪的總時間。實驗結果顯示: 本論文所提方法可以很快速規劃出訪員拜訪的路徑，再針對兩位訪員情況並且不會重複拜訪受訪家庭，可以有效的完成拜訪家庭參訪。本論文未來可以擴充為探討處理三位以上訪員之情況，並持續關注考量社區老人不在家裡的處理情況。",
      "abstract_en": "There are more and more elder people in our society and government home visitors need to visit the community elder. The traditional method usually assigns the one visitor to visit all community elder. Therefore, the home visitors usually can not find the home elders because they may go out to do something. Some approach explores the research for one visitor to all people and minimize the total length or other objective goals.\n\nIn this paper, we explore the problem which one or more home visitors to visitor all community elder to minimize the total time. We assume that the timing for each community elder by one home visitor is fixed. Each community elder is always at home unitl the visitor comes to visit. The algorithm uses the concept to guide the first home visitor to the unvisited community elders. Then the second home visitor is also to visit the unvisited community elders. For each community elder, the home visitor usually spends about half an hour to discuss with the community elders. The objective of this work is tom minimize the total time, including the timing from the source point to target point and the visiting timing of the home visitors discussing with the community elders. The contributions are as follows. First, we implement the algorithm, which community elders are visited by one home visitor. Second, we furthermore design the algorithm, which community elders are visited by two home visitors. Experimental results show that our approach can minimize the total visitor timing, such as the length time and the home discussion time, by two visitors to all community elders. The algorithm is efficient to find the routing paths for two visitors to their corresponding routing path from the starting point to the targets (i.e. community elders). Future work of the paper is to handle the number of visitor over two visitors.",
      "keywords": "路徑規劃、長壽社會、社區老人、多位家訪員 圖1 動機和說明問題的定義 圖2 兩訪員到社區老人的路徑規劃",
      "keywords_en": "Path finding algorithm, Longevity society; Community elder、Home visitors",
      "display_presenters": "黃瑞麟",
      "author_info_lines": [
        "黃瑞麟1 蘇聖煌2",
        "臺北市立大學學生1龍華科技大學助理教授2"
      ]
